<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson rises after U.S., pre results.</title>
<headline>Ericsson rises after U.S., pre results.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB rose almost three percent on Monday morning after gains in New York overnight Friday and ahead of posting its nine month results on Tuesday.</p>
<p>At 1000 GMT Ericsson was five crowns higher at 189.5 crowns.</p>
<p>A Reuter poll of 15 analysts forecast Ericsson reporting a pre-tax profit 6.24 billion crowns for the first nine months of 1996, which would correspond to a 29 percent rise over the corresponding period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
